# EXERCISE 01 - BASIC TRY / EXCEPT
# ============================================================
# Task:
# Ask the user for a number.
# Convert it to an integer.
# Handle invalid input using ValueError.
#
# Example:
# Enter a number: abc
# Output:
# Please enter a valid integer.
# ============================================================

